Fit the main view on 1440x810 screens without scrolling

At 1440x810 (773 px of usable height), the main view is 7 px taller than the
window, so a scrollbar appears for the last few pixels. Use the same 10 px
margin at the top as at the bottom.

--- a/src/mousam.py
+++ b/src/mousam.py
@@ -255,7 +255,7 @@
 
         # Main Grid Layout
         grid = Gtk.Grid()
-        grid.set_margin_top(20)
+        grid.set_margin_top(10)
         grid.set_margin_bottom(10)
         grid.set_margin_start(12)
         grid.set_margin_end(12)
